<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ocide Coders | Studio Portfolio</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Ocide Coders — a small studio crafting websites, products, and quiet digital tools. A part of Ocide.">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#17130F">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="favicon.svg">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header class="site-header" id="header">
        <div class="wrap header-inner">
            <a href="#top" class="brand">
                <span class="brand-dot"></span> Ocide Coders
            </a>
            <nav>
                <a href="#work">Work</a>
                <a href="#products">Products</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="wrap">
            <p class="hero-eyebrow">Studio · Bangladesh</p>
            <h1>We craft digital<br><span class="italic">homes</span> worth remembering.</h1>
            <p class="hero-lead">A small studio building websites, products, and quiet tools. Hand-coded from scratch — nothing generic.</p>
            <div class="hero-meta">
                <span>Est. 2026</span>
                <span>·</span>
                <span>Based in Dhaka</span>
                <span>·</span>
                <span>Working worldwide</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="work" id="work">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="section-head">
                <span class="section-tag">01 — Client Work</span>
                <h2>Portfolio for people who care about detail.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-2">
                <article class="project-card">
                    <a href="https://sybil-kailena.onrender.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">
                        <div class="card-visual">
                            <img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/t6vtwBk/20261014-233005.png" alt="Sybil Kailena Website">
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-meta">
                            <span class="card-cat">Client · Portfolio</span>
                            <h3>Sybil Kailena</h3>
                            <p>Personal brand and editorial portfolio for a Ukrainian glamour model — with a private members area, cinematic hero, and full SEO setup.</p>
                            <span class="card-cta">View live →</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <article class="project-card">
                    <a href="https://jia-lissa.onrender.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">
                        <div class="card-visual">
                            <img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/JwQmYMJy/20261014-232857.png" alt="Jia Lissa Website">
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-meta">
                            <span class="card-cat">Client · Portfolio</span>
                            <h3>Jia Lissa</h3>
                            <p>Split-screen editorial portfolio for a Russian model — warm ivory palette, Cormorant typography, and a full-screen social feed.</p>
                            <span class="card-cta">View live →</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="products" id="products">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="section-head">
                <span class="section-tag">02 — Products</span>
                <h2>Tools we build for ourselves.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-2">
                <article class="project-card">
                    <a href="https://meeel-page.onrender.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">
                        <div class="card-visual">
                            <img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/8ntCbnGg/20261014-233026.png" alt="meeEL App Builder">
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-meta">
                            <span class="card-cat">Product · By Ocide</span>
                            <h3>meeEL</h3>
                            <p>A no-code app builder with its own natural syntax. Write once — export to HTML, CSS, JS, and Python.</p>
                            <span class="card-cta">Explore →</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <article class="project-card">
                    <a href="https://eliget.onrender.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">
                        <div class="card-visual">
                            <img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/84Th07M4/20261014-232944.png" alt="Eliget Platform">
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-meta">
                            <span class="card-cat">Product · By Ocide</span>
                            <h3>Eliget</h3>
                            <p>A social-first platform connecting students and mentors — quiet design, focused features.</p>
                            <span class="card-cta">Explore →</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <div class="wrap contact-wrap">
            <div class="contact-text">
                <span class="section-tag">03 — Contact</span>
                <h2>Have a project in mind?</h2>
                <p>We take on a few projects at a time. Tell us about yours — we'll reply within 24 hours.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-action">
                <a href="mailto:ocidecoders@proton.me" class="btn-contact">ocidecoders@proton.me</a>
                <span class="contact-note">Or find us on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@OcideCoders" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="wrap footer-inner">
            <div class="footer-brand">
                <p class="footer-logo">Ocide Coders</p>
                <p class="footer-tag">A studio by Ocide.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-copy">
                <p>&copy; 2026 Ocide Coders. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
